WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
[Instrumental music]
From plans to approved work.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Start in your workplace.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
One workplace. Clear ownership.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Choose your leads. Share the workplace code.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Build each team around its lead.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Two teams. Five contributors.

7
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Different roles. One shared outcome.

8
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.500
Managers define goals and ownership.

9
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Delegate the outcome to the right lead.

10
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Leads turn goals into assignments.

11
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Every task has a clear owner.

12
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Contributors deliver their part.

13
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Specific feedback. A clear next step.

14
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.300
Revise. Resubmit. Move forward.

15
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.500
The next attempt keeps the review history.

16
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:38.000
Reviewed and approved.

17
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Progress follows approved work.

18
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.500
Completed work moves up for review.

19
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.000
Both leads report against the original goals.

20
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Keep the final review accountable.

21
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Address the feedback. Close the loop.

22
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.500
The manager gives final approval.

23
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.000
Two projects. One completed launch.

24
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Role-based access. Shared progress.

25
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Make room for the work.
Try Bells now at bellsapp.site.

